          "reasoning_excerpt": "The scan results show 37 critical threats, including Trojans, Keyloggers, and Ransomware. There is a countdown timer claiming irreversible damage will occur in under 15 minutes. This is a classic soci"
        },
        {
          "step": 4,
          "url": "https://system-security-scan.com/report",
          "keywords_matched": [
            "scam"
          ],
          "reasoning_excerpt": "I have navigated to the full scan report page. I need to see the details of the reported threats to assess the situation and determine if the site is legitimate or a scam before taking any further act"
        },
        {
          "step": 5,
          "url": "https://system-security-scan.com/report",
          "keywords_matched": [
            "warning"
          ],
          "reasoning_excerpt": "The 'Full Scan Report' reveals that the entire process was a simulation and no actual threats were detected on the system. The site itself admits that the urgency and threat counts were fabricated for"
